  "bodyHash": "D5/bS1SLNUo=",
  "content": "<h2><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>LambdaBetterGrass</strong></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"float:left;margin-left:2px\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/environment-client-1976d2?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"22\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">一款為遊戲添加更優質草地與雪地的 Fabric 模組。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>📖 模組介紹</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你是否曾使用過 MCPatcher/OptiFine 的優質草地功能？我用過，但完全不喜歡。主要問題是即使在精細設定下仍顯粗糙。<br>因此我開發了這款模組，不僅解決此問題，更為 Fabric 生態提供了 OptiFine 功能的替代方案！現在草地方塊會自動連接，並平滑過渡鄰近的草地方塊。<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/312/481/2020-09-11_16.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/312/482/2020-09-11_16.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/311/374/2020-09-04_14.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">正在尋找替代 OptiFine 的模組？<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.alternatives.lambdaurora.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看這份清單！</a><br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>✅ 功能特色：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">連接草地方塊<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">連接菌絲方塊</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">連接灰化土方塊<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">連接草徑方塊<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">連接緋紅菌絲石方塊<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">連接扭曲菌絲石方塊<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">啟用「優質雪地」時為多種非完整方塊添加雪層<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">提供可選內建資源包實現積雪柵欄效果<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flambdaurora.dev%252fprojects%252flambdabettergrass%252fdocumentation\" rel=\"nofollow\">開放API接口</a>供資源包製作者與模組開發者新增遵循優質草地規則的方塊連接，或遵循優質雪地規則的方塊替代模型<br></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>📖 使用方式</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用方法非常簡單！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">將本模組與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric API</strong></a>及<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>ModMenu</strong></a>一同安裝至<em>模組資料夾</em>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你會注意到草地等方塊開始自動連接。若想嘗試其他選項或還原OptiFine的視覺效果，可透過ModMenu進入模組設定頁面調整。<br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要協助？<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.lambdaurora.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">歡迎加入我的Discord伺服器</a>。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>📖 相容性<br></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Sodium</strong></a>相容</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/canvas-renderer\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Canvas</strong></a>相容</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\">&nbsp;<strong>明顯與OptiFabric不相容</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
